{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY SKULL AND BONES FOR FREE</h2>Ready your cannons and try the full game for 6 hours for free! All your progress will be saved and carried over upon purchase of the full game.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENGAGE IN SPECTACULAR NAVAL COMBAT</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853730/extras/86586fbce062232b51f12a402270c41f.poster.avif?t=1770767688\" width=600 height=345 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853730/extras/86586fbce062232b51f12a402270c41f.webm?t=1770767688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Prepare for devastating battles by crafting different ships and equip your fleet with powerful loadouts. Unlock stronger weapons as you progress and customize your ships to reflect your unique pirate playstyle.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SAIL INTO A DANGEROUS HELL IN PARADISE</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853730/extras/86cb725437d37b9fd0289a4c23c918a7.poster.avif?t=1770767688\" width=600 height=345 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853730/extras/86cb725437d37b9fd0289a4c23c918a7.webm?t=1770767688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Voyage into the Indian Ocean and explore a vast open world teeming with cutthroat pirates, deadly sea monsters, supernatural threats, devastating storms, and more.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TEAM UP WITH OR BATTLE AGAINST FELLOW PIRATES</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853730/extras/9bec46a4219dcca1c92a191e286ead8a.poster.avif?t=